    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a mouse event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is used to represent different types of mouse events, such as button presses or scrolls. It provides methods for getting the type and position of the mouse event. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
